<view class="page"><view class="profile-head"><image class="profile-avatar" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=300"/><view><view style="font-size:38rpx;font-weight:700">Alex Chen</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx">在路上，也在分享路上的风景。</view><view style="margin-top:14rpx"><text class="pill">旅行摄影</text><text class="pill">美食探索</text></view></view></view><view class="stats card"><view wx:for="{{stats}}" wx:key="l" style="text-align:center;flex:1"><view style="font-size:34rpx;font-weight:700;color:#173f4f">{{item.n}}</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:6rpx">{{item.l}}</view></view></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">我的空间</view><view class="muted">编辑资料 →</view></view><view class="card menu" wx:for="{{menus}}" wx:key="title" data-title="{{item.title}}" bindtap="open"><view class="menu-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><view style="flex:1"><view style="font-size:28rpx;font-weight:600">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:7rpx">{{item.desc}}</view></view><text class="muted">→</text></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">预算与支付</view><view class="muted">为后续支付预留</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view><view style="font-size:28rpx;font-weight:600">默认显示货币</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:7rpx">路线和商户会显示当地结算货币</view></view><picker mode="selector" range="{{currencies}}" value="{{currencies.indexOf(currency)}}" bindchange="changeCurrency"><view class="pill" style="background:#173f4f;color:#fff">{{currency}}⌄</view></picker></view><view class="pay-list"><text class="pill">Visa 优先</text><text class="pill">微信支付</text><text class="pill">支付宝</text><text class="pill">当地现金</text></view></view></view>
